接口名称：queryDesignDetail
接口描述：按 SurgicalDesignID 获取设计详情、患者信息、病例信息和模型文件信息。
分组：手术设计
网关分发指令：command=14005 (CommandId.QuerySurgicalDesignDetail)
代码来源：src/api/design/index.ts
Req:
{
  "SurgicalDesignID": "{{designId}}"
}
Res:
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "surgicalDesignDetail": {
      "ID": "design-id",
      "Version": 0,
      "Status": 1
    },
    "patientInfo": {
      "id": "patient-id",
      "name": "张三"
    },
    "medicalRecordInfo": {
      "id": "case-id"
    },
    "modelFileKey": "file-key",
    "extraModelFileKeys": [],
    "token": "download-token",
    "files": [],
    "jawType": "upper"
  },
  "message": "success"
}

接口名称：startSurgical
接口描述：将设计进入手术中状态并返回设计详情。
分组：手术设计
网关分发指令：command=14006 (CommandId.StartSurgical)
代码来源：src/api/design/index.ts
Req:
{
  "surgicalDesignID": "{{designId}}"
}
Res:
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "surgicalDesignDetail": {
      "ID": "design-id",
      "Status": 3
    }
  },
  "message": "success"
}

接口名称：finishSurgical
接口描述：提交手术完成信息和偏差信息。
分组：手术设计
网关分发指令：command=14007 (CommandId.FinishSurgical)
代码来源：src/api/design/index.ts
Req:
{
  "SurgicalDesignID": "{{designId}}",
  "SurgicalInfo": {
    "registration": {
      "handpieces": null,
      "jaw": null
    },
    "navigation": {
      "horizontalDeviationMin": null,
      "depthDeviationMin": null,
      "axialDeviationMin": null
    }
  }
}
Res:
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "content": "{}",
    "status": 4,
    "ApproveStatus": 1,
    "ModelFile": {}
  },
  "message": "success"
}

